\begin{theorem}[Triangle inequality]\label{thm:tri}
For all $x, y$, $\norm{x + y} \leq \norm{x} + \norm{y}$.
\end{theorem}

\begin{proof}
Expand the inner product and apply Cauchy--Schwarz.
\end{proof}

The norm $\norm{x}$ satisfies Theorem \ref{thm:tri}.

